    "body": "由正弦定理，\\(a:b:c=2:1:\\sqrt2\\)。已知b=√2，所以 \\(a=2\\sqrt2,c=2\\)。"
   },
   {
    "title": "求cos C",
    "body": "\\(\\cos C=(a^2+b^2-c^2)/(2ab)=(8+2-4)/8=3/4\\)。C为内角，所以 \\(\\sin C=\\sqrt7/4\\)。"
   },
   {
    "title": "求目标值",
    "body": "\\(\\sin2C=3\\sqrt7/8,\\cos2C=1/8\\)。因此 \\(\\sin(2C-\\pi/6)=(3\\sqrt7/8)(\\sqrt3/2)-(1/8)(1/2)=(3\\sqrt{21}-1)/16\\)。"
   }
  ],
  "check": "\\((3/4)^2+(\\sqrt7/4)^2=1\\)，且 \\((3\\sqrt7/8)^2+(1/8)^2=1\\)，两个三角值对均自洽。",
